    "detailed_description": "\ud83e\udde9Proverbs is <strong>digital cross-stitch</strong>. A meditative game about completing a single <strong>enormous</strong> 54,000+ piece grid puzzle.<br><br>\ud83d\udca3 If you know how to play minesweeper, you already know how to play a Mega Mosaic! The numbered clues (0-9) indicate how many light tiles must be placed within 1 square of the clue.<br><br>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Unravel the mysteries of Peter Bruegel the Elder's enigmatic painting <i>Netherlandish Proverbs</i>. Piece together over 100 illustrations of 16th century dutch proverbs and idioms, many of which will still be familiar today.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb6 Whether you're engrossed in your favourite podcasts or listening to your favourite tunes, Mega Mosaic: Proverbs serves as the perfect backdrop to enhance your experience. Or choose from the soothing built-in lo-fi or renaissance soundtracks.<br><br>\u23f3 Dozens of Hours of Addictive Gameplay: Get ready to lose yourself in hours of simple, calming but addictive puzzle-solving, with over 90 achievements to collect!",
    "about_the_game": "\ud83e\udde9Proverbs is <strong>digital cross-stitch</strong>. A meditative game about completing a single <strong>enormous</strong> 54,000+ piece grid puzzle.<br><br>\ud83d\udca3 If you know how to play minesweeper, you already know how to play a Mega Mosaic! The numbered clues (0-9) indicate how many light tiles must be placed within 1 square of the clue.<br><br>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Unravel the mysteries of Peter Bruegel the Elder's enigmatic painting <i>Netherlandish Proverbs</i>. Piece together over 100 illustrations of 16th century dutch proverbs and idioms, many of which will still be familiar today.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb6 Whether you're engrossed in your favourite podcasts or listening to your favourite tunes, Mega Mosaic: Proverbs serves as the perfect backdrop to enhance your experience. Or choose from the soothing built-in lo-fi or renaissance soundtracks.<br><br>\u23f3 Dozens of Hours of Addictive Gameplay: Get ready to lose yourself in hours of simple, calming but addictive puzzle-solving, with over 90 achievements to collect!",
    "short_description": "Proverbs is a picross/minesweeper hybrid featuring a single ENORMOUS puzzle, inspired by Bruegel the Elder's 1559 painting &quot;Netherlandish Proverbs&quot;",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cProverbs offers a unique blend of historical art and modern puzzle-solving that kept me hooked for over 30 hours. Its challenging gameplay, educational value, and satisfying achievements make it a must-play for puzzle enthusiasts\u201d<br>9.5/10 \u2013 The Gaming Outsider<br><br>\u201cProverbs presents its victim with a truly vast grid of squares, upon which you can zoom in and out like it's the Supreme Commander of puzzle games.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>",
